    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; font-size: 14pt; font-variant: small-caps; font-weight: bold;">NILSINE PARTNERS NP1X FUND</div>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 24pt; font-size: 12pt;">(the &#8220;<u>Fund</u>&#8221;)</div>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 24pt; font-size: 14pt; font-variant: small-caps; font-weight: bold;">SUBSCRIPTION DOCUMENTS</div>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 24pt; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">Class [___] Shares of Beneficial Interest in the Fund</div>
