    <div style="text-indent: 36pt; text-align: justify;"><font style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: normal;">(c)</font><font style="font-weight: normal;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</font> <font style="font-size: 12pt;"><font style="font-weight: bold;">Compliance with Laws and
          Other Instruments.&#160; </font>The execution and delivery of this Agreement by you, the consummation of the transactions contemplated hereby, and the performance of your obligations hereunder do not and will not conflict with, or result in any
