            </td>
            <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top;">
              <div style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 15px;">You are acquiring Shares for your own account or for one or more separate accounts maintained by you and not as agent, nominee, trustee, partner, or otherwise on behalf of,
