                engagement in transactions with, and the provision of services to, certain foreign countries, territories, entities, and individuals.<sup style="vertical-align: text-top; line-height: 1; font-size: smaller;">1</sup>&#160; The lists of OFAC prohibited countries, territories, persons, and entities can be found on
