                to &#8220;freeze the account&#8221; of such Subscriber, either by prohibiting additional investments from the Subscriber, suspending distributions, and/or segregating the assets in the account in compliance with governmental regulations, and the Fund,
                Adviser, and/or the Administrator may also be required to report such action and to disclose the Subscriber&#8217;s identity to OFAC or other applicable authorities.&#160; The Subscriber further acknowledges that the Adviser and/or the Administrator
