    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">&#160;</div>
    <div style="text-align: justify;"><font style="font-size: 12pt;">3.</font><font class="TRGRRTFtoHTMLTab" style="display: inline-block; text-indent: 0px; font-size: 1px; width: 36pt">&#160;</font><font style="font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic; font-weight: bold;">Bank Holding Fund Status</font></div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">&#160;</div>
    <div style="text-align: justify; margin-left: 36pt; font-size: 12pt;">Is the Subscriber a BHC Subscriber?<sup style="vertical-align: text-top; line-height: 1; font-size: smaller;">11</sup></div>
