    <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">Attachment 3</div>
    <div style="text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;"><u>Definitions</u></div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">&#160;</div>
    <div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt; font-size: 12pt;">&#8220;<u>U.S. Person</u>&#8221; for purposes of this Subscription Document is a person who is a person included in the definition of &#8220;U.S. Person&#8221; under Rule 902 of Regulation S under the
      Securities Act.</div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">&#160;</div>
    <div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt; font-size: 12pt;">Under Regulation S, &#8220;<u>U.S. Person</u>&#8221; generally includes the following:</div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">&#160;</div>
    <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" id="ze89fdbb2eb674d56832a463b5bebf183" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;">

        <tr>
