          </td>
          <td style="width: 95.51%; vertical-align: top;">
            <div style="text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt;">Any discretionary account or similar account (other than an estate or trust) held by a dealer or other fiduciary organized, incorporated, or (if an individual) resident in the United States;
              and</div>
          </td>
        </tr>

    </table>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt;">&#160;</div>
    <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" id="z38440d30e86b4c0883dc8c968f92cc12" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;">

        <tr>
          <td style="width: 0.16%; vertical-align: top;">&#160;</td>
